<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX, 1-YR RATE UP.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES MIXED AT FIX, 1-YR RATE UP.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>mixed at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Thursday with</p>
<p>the two shortest rates a shade lower and the longest maturity</p>
<p>a tick higher.	February 20 fix     February 19 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.07 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.24 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.34 pct		3.33 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
